Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `values` is already shared in this call, so it can't be changed here too
  --> tests/ui/ownership/wrapped_and_branch_returned_views_stay_live_through_outer_calls.jet:10:27
    |
 10 |     both((first(values)), values)
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being looked at, nobody else may be changing it
 Fix: Drop the extra use of `values`, or copy first with `values.copy()`
